# SS-10 - Local snapshots and reproducible studies
Workstream ID: SS-10
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/10
Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2
Dependencies: SS-03, SS-04

## Purpose
Preserve the exact inputs and assumptions needed to revisit a study without stale-data ambiguity.

## Tasks
- [ ] Define local SQLite metadata and permitted immutable observation snapshots.
- [ ] Record retrieval/version/hash, revisions, source terms and adjustment basis.
- [ ] Import/replay saved studies with schema validation and explicit historical labels.
- [ ] Add notebook annotations, comparisons, parameter versions and backup/export recovery.
- [ ] Isolate stable-use state from development profiles and test migrations recoverably.

## Acceptance criteria
- Cached/saved data is never labelled newly fetched or current.
- Raw market datasets and credentials stay outside public Git.

## Completion evidence
- Not started. M1 manual JSON export is not a full persistence/import system.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Registered local study storage and revision accounting.
